  "content": "<p>這個模組為村民新增了<em><strong>「怪物獵人」職業</strong></em></p><hr><p>怪物獵人擁有許多有趣的、<strong>與生物掉落物相關的交易</strong></p><p>他還會使用新的<strong>工作站：「獵人桌」</strong></p><hr><p><em><strong>目前特殊交易物品：</strong></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>黏性陷阱</strong></p><p>-可投擲，且比蜘蛛網更耐用的替代品</p><p>-能像蜘蛛網一樣減緩敵人的速度</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>鋒利陷阱</strong></p><p>-一種可投擲的陷阱，能對生物造成傷害</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>陷阱原型</strong></p><p>-可在獵人工作台上用來製作陷阱</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>獵人刀</strong></p><p>-每次攻擊將造成額外半顆心的傷害，外加該生物最大生命值的1-6%；若目標被困在陷阱中，則會造成額外2顆心的傷害，並附加該生物最大生命值的5-8%。同時還會賦予目標緩速II效果，持續2秒。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><strong>其他特殊物品：</strong></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>靈魂鎖鏈陷阱</strong></p><p>-一種可投擲的陷阱，能將生物拉向自身</p><p>-能像蜘蛛網一樣減緩敵人的速度</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>此模組使用 MCreator 製作</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmonster-hunter-villager\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth 頁面</a></em></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><em><strong>看看我的其他模組：</strong></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dark-side-creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/919/93/638380942855441364.jpeg\" alt=\"Dark Side\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monstrous-slimes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/930/440/638403264768147418.png\" alt=\"Monstrous Slimes\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yoshis-random-things\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/919/475/638381729117633371.jpeg\" alt=\"Yoshi's Random Things\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cataclysmic-creepers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/888/526/638327113429388003.png\" alt=\"Cataclysmic Creeper\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paper-and-cardboard\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/885/928/638322024567415536.png\" alt=\"Paper and Cardboard\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-falling\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/907/264/638358230142431941.png\" alt=\"Better Falling\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dont-void-arrows\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/888/583/638327202335050766.png\" alt=\"Don't void Arrows\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/barely-simple-staffs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/970/993/638472488188954369.png\" alt=\"Barely Simple Staffs\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><em><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skyfall-meteorites\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1000/129/256/256/638519030541684849_animated.gif\" alt=\"Skyfall: Meteorites\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quickshot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1080/153/256/256/638619438455340246_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glimmering-gardens\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1110/965/256/256/638662405266959303_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></strong></em></p>",
